{"2687000": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "no sleep for sole", "steam_appid": 2687000, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No Sleep for Sole is a surreal survival horror game about mental illness and abuse. You play as a young boy named Sole who stays awake at night to protect himself from the monsters he sees around his home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687000/extras/145150d5d2031892d5632a0f881b84b0.poster.avif?t=1787557607\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687000/extras/145150d5d2031892d5632a0f881b84b0.webm?t=1787557607\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687000/extras/145150d5d2031892d5632a0f881b84b0.mp4?t=1787557607\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A detailed, disturbing story about abuse and its consequences.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An hour and a half of content with multiple endings.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense survival gameplay that revolves around efficient use of resources.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Side-view sections that depict Sole's days.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets and delusions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2687000/extras/2baf98e03aeffb3fe3070dcd150e3cb5.poster